{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequenceBasic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequenceBasic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.KLRSpectralSequenceAtE2.e2_is_canonical_basis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.KLRSpectralSequenceAtE2.e2_is_canonical_basis","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L84-L84","doc":"E₂ page is the canonical basis decomposition (opaque marker). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.KLRSpectralSequenceAtE2.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.KLRSpectralSequenceAtE2.mk","kind":"ctor","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L82-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.KLRSpectralSequenceAtE2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.KLRSpectralSequenceAtE2","kind":"class","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L80-L84","doc":"Conditional class: KLR spectral sequence at E₂ recovers the\ncanonical basis. NEAR-MATCH tier; instance not constructed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.not_e2Degenerates_of_d2_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.not_e2Degenerates_of_d2_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L68-L73","doc":"`E₂`-degeneration is a real constraint: a page whose `d₂` sends some\nelement to a nonzero element is not degenerate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates.d_vanishes_above_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates.d_vanishes_above_two","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L66-L66","doc":"All differentials vanish for `r ≥ 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates.mk","kind":"ctor","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.E2Degenerates","kind":"class","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L56-L66","doc":"Conditional class: the spectral sequence degenerates at `E₂`, i.e.\nevery differential `d r` with `r ≥ 2` is zero.\n\nThe pages are bare types, so \"zero\" needs a `Zero` on each page; it is\ntaken as an instance argument.  Until 2026-11-15 the only field was\n`d_vanishes_above_two : True`, which every `S` satisfied; the field now\nsays what its name says.  NEAR-MATCH tier; no instance is constructed\n(that needs the upstream Hochschild / KLR machinery). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.d","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The differential at level `r` (positions are `ℤ`; the level shift\n`r` is cast to `ℤ` explicitly to avoid mixed `ℕ`/`ℤ` addition). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.E","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The page indexed by level `r`, position `(p, q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.SpectralSequencePage","kind":"structure","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/SpectralSequenceBasic.lean#L35-L48","doc":"**Spectral sequence page** at level `r`: a `(p, q)`-graded object\n`E r p q` together with a differential `d r : E r p q → E r (p+r) (q+1-r)`.\n\nEncoded type-level only; the actual Mathlib spectral-sequence\ninfrastructure would land in `Mathlib.Algebra.Homology.SpectralSequence`\nwhen categorified upstream. (A base ring is intentionally NOT a\nparameter — the pages are bare graded types at this scaffold level;\nan `R`-linear refinement is future work.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}